YIIYA DESIGN DNA / PRODUCTION CONTEXT

Identity:
- Yiiya is the operating system for intent: voice and reference images compile into production-ready web and spatial experiences.
- The app must feel like Bloomberg Terminal meets high-end creative studio: fast, dark, precise, editorial, and never generic.

SRL Institutional Tokens:
- Background: #050505
- Foreground: #EDEDED
- Border: #1A1A1A
- Accent: #EF9F27
- Surface: rgba(255,255,255,0.045)
- Muted text: rgba(237,237,237,0.62)
- Typeface: JetBrains Mono, Geist Mono, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace

Layout Systems:
- CENTERED_IMPACT: bold minimal hero; centered editorial headline; high contrast; one CTA.
- EDITORIAL_SPLIT: asymmetric 58/42 split; left copy, right visual; professional services, portfolio, agency.
- BENTO_GRID: modern startup/data layout; named grid areas; metrics and CTA cells.
- FEATURES_GRID: dense 3-column card system.
- FEATURES_HORIZONTAL: wide scroll/showcase row.

Generation Rules:
- Never return static HTML from AI. Return action JSON and layout/material tokens.
- Never use Lorem Ipsum, Company Name, or placeholder image services.
- Use grounded industry copy and Unsplash assets for business categories.
- Prefer clean sections with strong offer, proof, CTA, and founder-friendly copy.
- Every button in Yiiya UI must perform a clear action or disclose why it is disabled.

Spatial Rules:
- The 3D layer is never blank. Use a living MeshDistortMaterial blob by default.
- Speech maps directly to material props and Zustand state.
- Uploaded images instantly morph the blob locally; Fal Trellis 2 GLB replaces it when ready.
- In HYBRID mode, 3D never blocks HTML clicks.

QA Rules:
- Contrast must be at least 4.5:1.
- Mobile must not horizontally overflow.
- Sections must feel visually balanced and token-consistent.
- System feed must narrate routing, research, QA, autosave, publish, and spatial sync.

Routing Defaults:
- Conductor: Gemini 1.5 Flash.
- Researcher: Gemini 1.5 Pro with Google Search grounding.
- Architect: Claude 3.5 Sonnet.
- Critic: Claude 3.5 Haiku.
- Alchemist: GPT-4o Vision plus Fal Trellis 2.
